          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach {{COACH_NAME}} for personalized wellness coaching in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Book a free consult and download the starter guide.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#f7fafb; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#6b7280; --accent:#0f766e; --accent-2:#115e59; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\\n      --radius:12px; --max:1100px; --pad:28px;\\n      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n      color-scheme: light;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#eef2f5);color:#0f172a;line-height:1.45}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:36px auto;padding:24px;}\\n    header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:16px;align-items:center}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .brand svg{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--card);padding:8px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(15,23,42,0.06)}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:18px;margin:0;font-weight:700}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}\\n    nav a.primary{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);color:var(--accent-2)}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start;margin-top:22px}\\n    .panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:var(--pad);box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(15,23,42,0.06)}\\n    .lead{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#072f2c;margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}\\n    .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600}\\n    input[type=\\\"text\\\"],input[type=\\\"email\\\"],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6eef0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfeff);font-size:14px;color:#072f2c}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .row > *{flex:1}\\n    .muted{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .actions{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);color:var(--accent-2)}\\n    aside.info{padding:var(--pad);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .mini{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .mini svg{width:64px;height:64px}\\n    .meta{display:grid;gap:6px}\\n    .meta strong{display:block;color:#072f2c}\\n    .map{height:160px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),#e6f6f4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.03)}\\n    footer{margin-top:22px;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:transparent;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .faq{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    .faq-item{background:#ffffff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.03)}\\n    @media (max-width:900px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      header{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}\\n      nav{overflow:auto}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 48\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"logo\\\">\\n          <rect x=\\\"4\\\" y=\\\"4\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#e6f6f4\\\" />\\n          <path d=\\\"M12 28c4-6 8-10 16-10\\\" stroke=\\\"#0f766e\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.5\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" />\\n          <circle cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"16\\\" r=\\\"3\\\" fill=\\\"#115e59\\\" />\\n        </svg>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Pricing</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"primary\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"lead\\\">Get started — let\\u2019s make small wins that last</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"sub\\\">Reach out to schedule a free 20-minute clarity call with {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}. Tell us what outcome matters most and we\\u2019ll propose a clear next step.</p>\\n\\n        <form class=\\\"contact-grid\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" novalidate>\\n          <div>\\n            <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Jane Doe\\\" required />\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@domain.com\\\" required />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"(optional)\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <label for=\\\"interest\\\">Which offering are you most interested in?</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"interest\\\" name=\\\"interest\\\">\\n              <option>Personal Wellness Path</option>\\n              <option>Hybrid Habit Coaching</option>\\n              <option>Team Wellbeing Workshops</option>\\n              <option>Not sure \\u2014 need guidance</option>\\n            </select>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"What goal would you like support with?\\\"></textarea>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n            <label style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"lead\\\" /> Send me the starter guide (lead magnet)</label>\\n            <div class=\\\"actions\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Request consult</button>\\n              <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">See availability</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        <footer>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">We typically reply within 48 hours. If urgent, call us at <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong>.</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"text-align:right;color:var(--muted)\\\">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        </footer>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"panel info\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"mini\\\">\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"coach\\\">\\n            <rect x=\\\"2\\\" y=\\\"2\\\" width=\\\"60\\\" height=\\\"60\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" />\\n            <circle cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"22\\\" r=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"#e6f6f4\\\" />\\n            <path d=\\\"M18 50c4-6 10-9 14-9s10 3 14 9\\\" stroke=\\\"#115e59\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" />\\n          </svg>\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Talk with {{COACH_NAME}}</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{CREDENTIALS}} \\u2022 Wellness coach focused on sustainable habits</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n          <div><strong>Phone</strong><span class=\\\"muted\\\">{{PHONE}}</span></div>\\n          <div><strong>Email</strong><span class=\\\"muted\\\">{{EMAIL}}</span></div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\\\">Office</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"map\\\">\\n            <!-- local SVG pattern used as a light map / illustration -->\\n            <img src=\\\"assets/img/pattern.svg\\\" alt=\\\"location illustration\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\\\">Quick links</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent-2);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600\\\">Explore Programs</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent-2);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600\\\">Compare Tiers</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent-2);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600\\\">Success stories</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\" class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Helpful questions</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n          <strong>How does the free clarity call work?</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">The 20-minute call lets us understand your primary goal, current routines, and the best first step. We'll recommend a tailored plan or the appropriate program tier.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n          <strong>What should I expect after signing up?</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">You\\u2019ll receive an email with intake questions, a suggested starter habit, and scheduling options for your first session.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n          <strong>Do you offer hybrid coaching (online + in-person)?</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Yes. We offer flexible hybrid coaching blocks — a mix of virtual sessions and occasional in-person meetups in {{CITY}} when appropriate.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# wellness_coach-2026-02-16T05-00-34-659Z-033 (clinic_modern)\\n\\nThis chunk contains the contact page and a brief README for the clinic_modern wellness coach template.\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html  -- The contact page. Contains a contact form, details for phone & email, coach avatar, an illustrative map area and a small FAQ. It references the local SVG assets at assets/img/pattern.svg (and expects assets/img/hero.svg and assets/img/avatar.svg to exist elsewhere in the project).\\n\\nPlaceholders present in templates (replace these during deployment):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{COACH_NAME}}\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n\\nNotes for implementers:\\n- The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. Update action if you have a specific endpoint or form handler.\\n- No external fonts or CDNs are used. The stylesheet is inline and built for a calm, clinical grid layout consistent with \\\"clinic_modern\\\".\\n- Accessibility: basic labels are provided. Validate server-side and add CSRF protections as needed.\\n- Assets: the page references local SVGs under assets/img/. Ensure the following are present in the project root assets folder:\\n  - assets/img/hero.svg\\n  - assets/img/avatar.svg\\n  - assets/img/pattern.svg\\n\\nCustomization hints:\\n- Tone: voiceFamily is \\\"coach_friend\\\". Keep copy energetic, approachable, and outcome-focused.\\n- Programs/Pricing/Testimonials pages should carry the required sections (hero, story, framework, programs, pricing, testimonials, cta) on the index and be reflected across pages for cohesion.\\n- Update meta description and title tags for SEO.\\n\\nIntegration:\\n- This contact page links to other pages in the bundle (index.html, about.html, programs.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html) — ensure those files are present in your build.\\n\\nLegal & content guidance:\\n- The copy avoids medical claims. Keep program language focused on habits, goals, and coaching outcomes.\\n\\nIf you need additional pages, SVGs, or a form processor example, request the next chunk with the relevant assets or server-side integration notes.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
